summary:
  The heal's second look counts every look towards a silent address, also
  the ones its server answered.

history:
  2026.43 moves a station when its old address has been silent on three
  looks five minutes apart. The count was of looks, not of silences: a busy
  503, then a 429, then one timeout made three, and so did two answers whose
  place Qt does not name followed by one timeout. Found 2026-11-11, the day
  2026.43 went out. The count is of unanswered looks in a row, and any answer
  starts it again.

target:
  package/contents/ui/KinHunt.qml

find:
              move.silent = status === 0 ? (move.silent || 0) + 1 : 0;

replace:
              move.silent = (move.silent || 0) + 1;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_kinhunt.qml::test_only_silence_in_a_row_counts_as_silence
  and tests/qml/tst_kinhunt.qml::test_an_answer_between_two_silences_starts_the_count_again.
  Line-neutral.
